<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:vehu_rachum_arokh/97"/>the Almighty Who is our deliverance,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:vehu_rachum_arokh/98"/>forever.
